graph TB
    subgraph "Model Registry Platform"
        subgraph "BFF (Backend-for-Frontend)"
            BFF[BFF Server<br/>Go / Port 8080]
            ReactUI[React SPA<br/>Node.js Frontend]
            BFF -->|serves| ReactUI
        end

        subgraph "Core Registry"
            Registry[model-registry<br/>Go Proxy / Port 8080<br/>FIPS-enabled Go 1.26]
        end

        subgraph "Catalog System"
            CatalogServer[model-catalog-server<br/>Deployment / Port 8080<br/>Plugin-based Routes]
            CatalogDB[(model-catalog-postgres<br/>StatefulSet / Port 5432<br/>PostgreSQL 17.6)]
            CatalogServer -->|stores data| CatalogDB
        end

        subgraph "Controller"
            Manager[manager<br/>Controller Binary<br/>Health: 8081]
        end

        subgraph "Python Client"
            PyClient[Python Client Library<br/>model-registry 0.3.9]
        end
    end

    User[Data Scientist / Developer] -->|REST API /api/v1/| BFF
    User -->|Web UI| ReactUI

    BFF -->|SAR AuthZ| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP]
    BFF -->|proxy requests| Registry
    BFF -->|proxy requests| CatalogServer

    Manager -->|watches| InferenceServiceCR[InferenceService CR<br/>serving.kserve.io/v1beta1]
    Manager -->|reconciles| K8sAPI

    PyClient -->|REST API| Registry
    PyClient -->|upload artifacts| S3[S3-compatible Storage]
    PyClient -->|push/pull| OCI[OCI Registry]

    Registry -->|CRUD| K8sAPI

